<title>GERMANY: Germans bid for 21,600 tonnes of intervention rye.</title>
<headline>Germans bid for 21,600 tonnes of intervention rye.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders placed bids for the export of 21,600 tonnes of intervention rye to third countries, state grain intervention board BLE said.</p>
<p>The bids will be discussed at the EU weekly grain meeting later on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
